  "scenes": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "start": 0,
      "end": 29.61,
      "captions": [
        {
          "text": "我是雨哥的数字助理晓晓。",
          "start": 0.3,
          "end": 2.174416,
          "relative": false
        },
        {
          "text": "咱们先看一件身边的事：",
          "start": 2.613625,
          "end": 4.233957,
          "relative": false
        },
        {
          "text": "闹钟每天自己响，",
          "start": 4.581208,
          "end": 5.935375,
          "relative": false
        },
        {
          "text": "地图自己找路线，",
          "start": 6.1899999999999995,
          "end": 7.4284159999999995,
          "relative": false
        },
        {
          "text": "客服自己回留言，",
          "start": 7.671499999999999,
          "end": 8.967790999999998,
          "relative": false
        },
        {
          "text": "这些都算AI吗？",
          "start": 9.187666,
          "end": 10.553416000000002,
          "relative": false
        },
        {
          "text": "光看“自己会动”，",
          "start": 11.074250000000001,
          "end": 12.173791000000001,
          "relative": false
        },
        {
          "text": "还分不出来。",
          "start": 12.393708000000002,
          "end": 13.238625,
          "relative": false
        },
        {
          "text": "闹钟可能只是到了时间就响；",
          "start": 13.759458,
          "end": 15.831207000000001,
          "relative": false
        },
        {
          "text": "地图要比较道路；",
          "start": 16.166833,
          "end": 17.439999,
          "relative": false
        },
        {
          "text": "客服还得处理不同说法。",
          "start": 17.729333,
          "end": 19.639083000000003,
          "relative": false
        },
        {
          "text": "这一讲就拿它们当例子，",
          "start": 20.1715,
          "end": 22.023333,
          "relative": false
        },
        {
          "text": "看看系统收到了什么、",
          "start": 22.312666,
          "end": 23.747875,
          "relative": false
        },
        {
          "text": "怎么处理、",
          "start": 23.990916000000002,
          "end": 24.696957,
          "relative": false
        },
        {
          "text": "最后给了什么结果。",
          "start": 24.916833,
          "end": 26.189999,
          "relative": false
        },
        {
          "text": "先把事情看明白，",
          "start": 26.722416000000003,
          "end": 27.937666,
          "relative": false
        },
        {
          "text": "术语就好理解了。",
          "start": 28.18075,
          "end": 29.442291,
          "relative": false
        }
      ],
