    {
      "id": 2,
      "start": 29.61,
      "end": 56.120000000000005,
      "captions": [
        {
          "text": "比如你把闹钟设在晚上八点，",
          "start": 29.61,
          "end": 31.911124,
          "relative": false
        },
        {
          "text": "它到了八点就响，",
          "start": 32.154166000000004,
          "end": 33.288416,
          "relative": false
        },
        {
          "text": "这叫固定提醒。",
          "start": 33.543041,
          "end": 34.665749,
          "relative": false
        },
        {
          "text": "地图拿到道路连接和通行成本，",
          "start": 35.194458,
          "end": 37.601832,
          "relative": false
        },
        {
          "text": "要比较哪些路能走、",
          "start": 37.891208,
          "end": 39.280125,
          "relative": false
        },
        {
          "text": "走哪条更合适。",
          "start": 39.465291,
          "end": 40.680583,
          "relative": false
        },
        {
          "text": "客服收到“东西还没到”，",
          "start": 41.201375,
          "end": 42.729166,
          "relative": false
        },
        {
          "text": "可能要判断这是物流问题。",
          "start": 42.995374999999996,
          "end": 45.020832999999996,
          "relative": false
        },
        {
          "text": "它们都能自动运行，",
          "start": 45.541666,
          "end": 46.942124,
          "relative": false
        },
        {
          "text": "但做事的办法不同。",
          "start": 47.173625,
          "end": 48.562499,
          "relative": false
        },
        {
          "text": "自动化这个词，",
          "start": 49.094916,
          "end": 50.136583,
          "relative": false
        },
        {
          "text": "先告诉我们哪些动作不用人做；",
          "start": 50.402791,
          "end": 52.671333000000004,
          "relative": false
        },
        {
          "text": "至于用了什么AI能力，",
          "start": 53.030083000000005,
          "end": 54.812499,
          "relative": false
        },
        {
          "text": "还得往里面看。",
          "start": 55.00925,
          "end": 55.958332999999996,
          "relative": false
        }
      ],
