    {
      "id": 3,
      "start": 56.120000000000005,
      "end": 85.25,
      "captions": [
        {
          "text": "接着看客服怎么接住一句话。",
          "start": 56.120000000000005,
          "end": 58.351666,
          "relative": false
        },
        {
          "text": "先把声音听成文字，",
          "start": 58.88037500000001,
          "end": 60.37345800000001,
          "relative": false
        },
        {
          "text": "这是识别，",
          "start": 60.58175000000001,
          "end": 61.368791,
          "relative": false
        },
        {
          "text": "也可以叫感知；",
          "start": 61.542416,
          "end": 62.54933200000001,
          "relative": false
        },
        {
          "text": "再判断客户在问什么；",
          "start": 62.908166,
          "end": 64.47066600000001,
          "relative": false
        },
        {
          "text": "最后写出回复，",
          "start": 64.79470800000001,
          "end": 65.975291,
          "relative": false
        },
        {
          "text": "或者选择下一步。",
          "start": 66.183625,
          "end": 67.43362400000001,
          "relative": false
        },
        {
          "text": "这些位置能帮我们看流程。",
          "start": 67.96600000000001,
          "end": 70.08408200000001,
          "relative": false
        },
        {
          "text": "但一个AI系统可以只负责其中一段，",
          "start": 70.604916,
          "end": 73.44054100000001,
          "relative": false
        },
        {
          "text": "比如只把录音转成文字。它也不用一定会",
          "start": 73.76462500000001,
          "end": 77.32941600000001,
          "relative": false
        },
        {
          "text": "聊天。实际产品还会接上普通程序，图上",
          "start": 77.34100000000001,
          "end": 81.48454100000001,
          "relative": false
        },
        {
          "text": "的顺序只是帮助理解，不能套在所有系统上。",
          "start": 81.48454100000001,
          "end": 85.118791,
          "relative": false
        }
      ],
