    {
      "id": 4,
      "start": 85.25,
      "end": 116.78999999999999,
      "captions": [
        {
          "text": "要把“想退货”分到退货问题里",
          "start": 85.25,
          "end": 87.620541,
          "relative": false
        },
        {
          "text": "可以让人写条件：",
          "start": 87.724708,
          "end": 88.858999,
          "relative": false
        },
        {
          "text": "看见这个词，就放进这一类。",
          "start": 89.206208,
          "end": 91.231666,
          "relative": false
        },
        {
          "text": "也可以给系统看许多已经分好类的留言",
          "start": 91.748791,
          "end": 94.792791,
          "relative": false
        },
        {
          "text": "让它通过训练调整参数。",
          "start": 94.885375,
          "end": 96.714083,
          "relative": false
        },
        {
          "text": "等一下，",
          "start": 97.2465,
          "end": 97.767291,
          "relative": false
        },
        {
          "text": "这两种办法容易混",
          "start": 98.07983300000001,
          "end": 99.422416,
          "relative": false
        },
        {
          "text": "咱们分开看。",
          "start": 99.503416,
          "end": 100.394625,
          "relative": false
        },
        {
          "text": "这类从例子里学的办法，叫机器学习。",
          "start": 100.915458,
          "end": 104.00575,
          "relative": false
        },
        {
          "text": "地图找路线还可以用人设计的搜索算法。",
          "start": 104.526583,
          "end": 107.454832,
          "relative": false
        },
        {
          "text": "你看，AI里面有多种做法",
          "start": 107.987208,
          "end": 110.348333,
          "relative": false
        },
        {
          "text": "机器学习是重要的一类；",
          "start": 110.440916,
          "end": 112.084457,
          "relative": false
        },
        {
          "text": "简单闹钟会自动响",
          "start": 112.258041,
          "end": 113.843707,
          "relative": false
        },
        {
          "text": "也不能仅凭这一点判断它用了AI。",
          "start": 113.936291,
          "end": 116.66775,
          "relative": false
        }
      ],
