    {
      "id": 5,
      "start": 116.78999999999999,
      "end": 145.93,
      "captions": [
        {
          "text": "假设客服先判断了客户的问题",
          "start": 116.78999999999999,
          "end": 119.12583299999999,
          "relative": false
        },
        {
          "text": "再由程序把回复存下来",
          "start": 119.21841599999999,
          "end": 121.081874,
          "relative": false
        },
        {
          "text": "最后请人确认后发送。",
          "start": 121.17445799999999,
          "end": 122.73695799999999,
          "relative": false
        },
        {
          "text": "这个流程里，",
          "start": 123.265666,
          "end": 124.08741599999999,
          "relative": false
        },
        {
          "text": "AI、普通程序和人可以一起工作。",
          "start": 124.342041,
          "end": 127.154541,
          "relative": false
        },
        {
          "text": "自动化看的是多少步骤由系统执行",
          "start": 127.68695799999999,
          "end": 130.44158299999998,
          "relative": false
        },
        {
          "text": "AI能力看的是判断和处理靠什么办法。",
          "start": 130.534166,
          "end": 133.624458,
          "relative": false
        },
        {
          "text": "全部自动执行",
          "start": 134.156833,
          "end": 135.349,
          "relative": false
        },
        {
          "text": "不代表全部判断正确。",
          "start": 135.45316599999998,
          "end": 137.166124,
          "relative": false
        },
        {
          "text": "一个聊天窗口",
          "start": 137.6985,
          "end": 138.786499,
          "relative": false
        },
        {
          "text": "也不能证明里面每一步都是大模型。",
          "start": 138.87908299999998,
          "end": 141.517958,
          "relative": false
        },
        {
          "text": "要了解它，还得看流程",
          "start": 142.038791,
          "end": 143.844374,
          "relative": false
        },
        {
          "text": "技术说明和实际结果。",
          "start": 143.85591599999998,
          "end": 145.76566599999998,
          "relative": false
        }
