    {
      "id": 6,
      "start": 145.93,
      "end": 177.95000000000002,
      "captions": [
        {
          "text": "先示范怎么写身份卡。",
          "start": 145.93,
          "end": 147.792874,
          "relative": false
        },
        {
          "text": "拿闹钟来说：",
          "start": 148.321583,
          "end": 149.282207,
          "relative": false
        },
        {
          "text": "它收到当前时间",
          "start": 149.606291,
          "end": 150.96045800000002,
          "relative": false
        },
        {
          "text": "要在晚上八点提醒",
          "start": 151.0415,
          "end": 152.372499,
          "relative": false
        },
        {
          "text": "办法是到点响铃。",
          "start": 152.384083,
          "end": 153.842374,
          "relative": false
        },
        {
          "text": "再看地图卡：",
          "start": 154.374833,
          "end": 155.289166,
          "relative": false
        },
        {
          "text": "它收到道路和通行成本",
          "start": 155.566958,
          "end": 157.395666,
          "relative": false
        },
        {
          "text": "要找路线",
          "start": 157.476666,
          "end": 158.101666,
          "relative": false
        },
        {
          "text": "卡片写明用搜索。",
          "start": 158.11325,
          "end": 159.768333,
          "relative": false
        },
        {
          "text": "第三张是用分好类的留言训练分类模型。",
          "start": 160.30075,
          "end": 163.691958,
          "relative": false
        },
        {
          "text": "到这儿先缓一下",
          "start": 164.224333,
          "end": 165.32387400000002,
          "relative": false
        },
        {
          "text": "看看这三张卡。",
          "start": 165.4165,
          "end": 166.458124,
          "relative": false
        },
        {
          "text": "现在暂停三分钟",
          "start": 166.979,
          "end": 168.390999,
          "relative": false
        },
        {
          "text": "照这个写法补齐三张卡；",
          "start": 168.39100000000002,
          "end": 170.347041,
          "relative": false
        },
        {
          "text": "没有证据的内部办法",
          "start": 170.71741600000001,
          "end": 172.083124,
          "relative": false
        },
        {
          "text": "写“未知”就行。",
          "start": 172.17575,
          "end": 173.20583200000002,
          "relative": false
        },
        {
          "text": "我们练的是把系统讲具体",
          "start": 173.726666,
          "end": 175.798416,
          "relative": false
        },
        {
          "text": "不给商业产品硬贴标签。",
          "start": 175.89100000000002,
          "end": 177.777625,
          "relative": false
        }
      ],
