    {
      "id": 7,
      "start": 177.95000000000002,
      "end": 206.66000000000003,
      "captions": [
        {
          "text": "设想两个都叫“AI客服”的系统。",
          "start": 177.95000000000002,
          "end": 180.39154100000002,
          "relative": false
        },
        {
          "text": "甲只匹配预设问题，给固定答案；",
          "start": 180.92029100000002,
          "end": 183.478125,
          "relative": false
        },
        {
          "text": "乙识别客户意思，再找资料写回答。",
          "start": 183.79066600000002,
          "end": 186.591583,
          "relative": false
        },
        {
          "text": "甲在固定问题上可能更稳定，",
          "start": 187.11241600000002,
          "end": 189.33462500000002,
          "relative": false
        },
        {
          "text": "乙可能听懂更多说法，",
          "start": 189.60083300000002,
          "end": 191.11704100000003,
          "relative": false
        },
        {
          "text": "也多了找错资料、",
          "start": 191.371666,
          "end": 192.575374,
          "relative": false
        },
        {
          "text": "写错内容的机会。",
          "start": 192.76054100000002,
          "end": 193.99899900000003,
          "relative": false
        },
        {
          "text": "选哪个，",
          "start": 194.53137500000003,
          "end": 195.21425000000002,
          "relative": false
        },
        {
          "text": "要看你的问题、",
          "start": 195.48045800000003,
          "end": 196.45270800000003,
          "relative": false
        },
        {
          "text": "回复依据和转人工条件。",
          "start": 196.637875,
          "end": 198.62858200000002,
          "relative": false
        },
        {
          "text": "名字一样，",
          "start": 199.161,
          "end": 199.85545800000003,
          "relative": false
        },
        {
          "text": "适用范围可以差很多。",
          "start": 200.121666,
          "end": 201.626291,
          "relative": false
        },
        {
          "text": "这是教学情境，",
          "start": 202.15870800000002,
          "end": 203.292957,
          "relative": false
        },
        {
          "text": "不能拿它替某个真实产品",
          "start": 203.559166,
          "end": 205.445749,
          "relative": false
        },
        {
          "text": "作技术鉴定。",
          "start": 205.52675000000002,
          "end": 206.47583200000003,
          "relative": false
        }
      ],
